WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-GB

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.860
David Roberts: I have nothing to add to the
report, other than to point out that, in December,

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:25.980
we had a discussion with the Greater Manchester
team, and I think we would record really good

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:36.070
progress and strong alignment. Therefore,
we have I think quite a lot of hope and anticipation

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:44.140
that we will see continued improvement in
outcomes and efficiency over the coming years.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:50.210
I think there is quite a lot we can learn
as to what can get done within existing rules,

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:58.570
without having to change and go into significant
devolved activity; there is a lot that can

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:05.379
be done within existing freedoms, and I think
we are looking at where else that those lessons

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:09.420
can be applied, particularly in the context
of STPs.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.939
Moira Gibb: I do not think there is anything
I want to add.

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:22.619
Malcolm Grant: Okay; we are being asked to
ratify the updated terms of reference of the

00:01:22.619 --> 00:01:27.520
Investment Committee. May I put that to the
Board? That is agreed, thank you very much.

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:37.179
Joanne Shaw: Nothing to add, but happy to
take questions if there are any.

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:41.460
Malcolm Grant: I think we have all read the
reports. Many of us are on the committees,

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:46.380
so I think it is a very important part of
good governance that good reports are brought

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:49.869
to the Board, and that we approve them.

00:01:49.869 --> 00:01:54.229
On that note, moving on to any other business.
I do not have any other business; I have not

00:01:54.229 --> 00:01:59.060
been notified of any other business. Is there
anything else? In which case, may I invite

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:04.259
the Board to pass the usual resolution relating
to private business, and declare the meeting

00:02:04.259 --> 00:02:06.639
closed. Thank you very much.

